      "tldr": {
        "zh": "AW-0 在 WAM 中加入代码专家，将技能程序、未来视频和动作块联合去噪生成，让代码计划同时引导视觉预测与动作生成，并支持按检查结果切换代码技能执行和模型动作执行。",
        "en": "AW-0 adds a code expert to a WAM and jointly denoises skill programs, future video and action chunks, letting code plans guide both visual prediction and action generation; an optional checked hybrid mode switches between programmatic skills and model-generated actions."
      },
      "evaluation_scope": {
        "zh": "输入当前三视角 RGB、指令、本体状态及历史代码记忆；三个专家在同一去噪循环中生成，跨专家注意力按代码→视频→动作组织，动作同时读取代码和视频。默认代码仅为计划条件，执行动作专家的 32 步动作块；真机统一 64 维表示为每侧 9 维末端位姿、22 手关节和 1 夹爪宽度，未用分量置零，动作使用末端相对位姿及绝对夹爪／手指目标。混合模式仅在阶段、依赖、语法、白名单等检查通过时执行代码；若已尝试代码执行，即使报错也丢弃同轮动作块，下轮重新观察规划。Agent 为机器人／人类示范标注代码并整理技能库，代码用掩码交叉熵、视频与动作用流匹配监督训练；约 2000 小时机器人＋1000 小时人类数据预训练后仍需任务微调，无 RL。YAM 双夹爪和 Tianji–Sharpa 双 22-DoF 手各测四任务，每任务 100 条示范、3×16 次评测；71.1% 是八任务平均评分，不是完整任务成功率。RoboTwin 默认 clean／random 成功率为 80.8%／20.6%；混合模式为 63.1%／29.2%，但仿真混合配置另用 CaP 生成示范，不能将差异全部归因于执行切换。真机混合模式另在叠毛巾验证。代码和混合数据预训练 checkpoint 已公开，预训练语料及初始化 Cosmos 视频权重未随附；下游任务权重开放情况未核实。",
        "en": "Inputs are current three-view RGB, instructions, proprioception and program-history memory. Three experts share one denoising loop with code-to-video-to-action attention; actions read both code and video. Default code is a planning condition; the action expert executes 32-step chunks. The real-world 64-D space contains, per side, 9 end-effector pose dimensions, 22 finger joints and one gripper width, zeroing unused blocks; actions use relative end-effector poses and absolute gripper/finger targets. Hybrid execution requires stage, dependency, syntax and whitelist checks. Once code execution is attempted, its same-pass action chunk is discarded even on error; the next iteration observes and replans. Agents annotate robot/human demonstrations and curate skills; code uses masked cross-entropy and video/actions use supervised flow matching, without RL. Approximately 2,000 robot and 1,000 human hours precede task fine-tuning. YAM dual grippers and Tianji–Sharpa dual 22-DoF hands each evaluate four tasks with 100 demonstrations and 3-by-16 trials per task. The 71.1% eight-task mean is a rubric score, not full-task success. RoboTwin clean/random success is 80.8%/20.6% by default and 63.1%/29.2% in hybrid mode, but hybrid simulation uses separate CaP-generated demonstrations, preventing attribution solely to execution switching. Hardware hybrid execution is additionally tested on towel folding/stacking. Code and a mixed-data pretrained checkpoint are public; pretraining corpora and the initializing Cosmos video checkpoint are not included. Downstream-task weight releases remain unverified."
      },
